pq2 is Nick Bollom's remake of Progress Quest, the 2002 game by Eric
Fredricksen (http://progressquest.com). It is not the original and is
not made or endorsed by Eric Fredricksen.

pq2 is free software under the GNU General Public License, version 3:
see LICENSE. Its source, with the changes made for the Asciiverse
catalog listed in PATCHES.md, is at https://github.com/theasciiverse/pq2
(upstream: https://github.com/nbollom/pq2).

Its game data (races, classes, monsters, spells, items and the rest)
comes from Progress Quest, which Eric Fredricksen released under the MIT
licence: see LICENSE.progressquest, copied from
http://progressquest.com/license.txt.

The program includes nlohmann/json 3.11.3 by Niels Lohmann, under the
MIT licence: see LICENSE.nlohmann_json.
